  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 17. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 会合 — 人が集まって話し合うこと。\n2. 開催 — 催しや会を開くこと。\n3. 改札 — 駅などで乗車券やICカードを確かめること。\n4. 改札口 — 駅で乗車券などを確かめて通る入口や出口。\n5. 海産物 — 海でとれる魚や海藻など。\n6. 会社 — 物を作ったり売ったりする仕事を組織で行うところ。\n7. 解釈 — 言葉や物事の意味を考えて受け取ること。\n8. 回収 — 配った物や使い終わった物などを集めること。\n9. 楷書 — 点や画を省略せず整えて書く漢字の書き方。\n10. 解消 — 困り事などをなくすこと。\n11. 会食 — 人と集まって食事をすること。\n12. 怪獣 — 物語などに登場する不思議な大きな獣。\n13. 解除 — かけてあった制限や仕組みを取り除くこと。\n14. 会場 — 会や催しを行う場所。\n15. 海水 — 海の水。\n16. 海水浴場 — 海で泳げるように整えられた場所。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\n",
